<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "substituting section 7 with the following: \"Recovery 7. (1) Subject to subsection (2), a person of specific entitled to the possession of specific immovable immovable property. property may recover it in the manner prescribed by the law relating to civil procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@> .
