<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a specific immovable property has been let under a tenancy, and that tenancy is determined or has come to an end, but the occupier continues to remain in occupation of the property or part thereof, the person entitled to the possession of the property shall not enforce his right to recover it against the occupier otherwise than by proceedings in the court."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@> .
