<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "In subsection (2) \"occupier\" means any person lawfully in occupation of the property or part thereof at the termination of the tenancy.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/27/eng@> .
